---
import SectionHeading from '@/components/ui/SectionHeading.astro';
import { Link } from '@/components/ui/link';
---

<section id="identity" class="py-16 px-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-slate-100">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl space-y-6 sm:space-y-8 text-slate-900">
    <SectionHeading
      title="Rooted in Enderly Park for over 20 years"
      subtitle="QC Family Tree stands where culture, housing, and community care meet."
      subtitleClass="text-lg text-slate-600"
    />
    <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-700">
      <p>
        We exist in a culture stitched together by extraction and domination. QCFT practices
        the opposite: extravagant care, mutual aid, and creativity that rails against scarcity.
        The work happens in the neighborhood, through relationships, collaborative art, and
        co-created spaces where people can belong.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our model is intentionally intersectional—housing justice, cultural organizing, and
        neighborhood-strengthening programs combine to create a commons of abundance. Every
        project is a step toward undoing the Imperial Death Culture that says there are
        limited resources and limited joy.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-center">
      <Link
        href="/about"
        variant="outline"
        className="rounded-xl px-6 py-3"
      >
        Read the full story
      </Link>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
